5,1,1,talk,Midori,,I worry about sustainability. Where do these programs usually break down after the first year?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,We have buried too many initiatives. I need to know what actually changed for patients before.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Misaki,,Rosters are where new programs land. I need to see the staffing pressure points.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,"The budget is often voted as a whole, but running costs appear later. I need the real numbers.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,Everything must fit into the existing day. I am concerned about rooms and access capacity.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shion, if the budget is cut, which programs survive? I am looking for the weak links.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Misaki, if staffing is tight, which teams are already stretched? I want to see the gaps.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Shizue, if the day is full, where does the new work go? I need the roster data.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Midori, I am checking the ledger. The allocation is down, and fitting out is charged to it.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Jonathan, I am looking at the booking system. It only records named slots, which hides the real load.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Midori,,I will check the board minutes on the jointly run clinic. It closed quickly.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I will look at the readmission figures from the call-back trial. Data beats memory.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I will review the therapy and midwifery staffing. I need to see who is leaving.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shion,,I will also check the regional fund tariffs. Location affects revenue significantly.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"I will check the rooms, parking, and shuttle coverage. I need to know the physical limits.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
