35,2,1,talk,Midori,,The board minutes show the joint clinic closed because neither department held the budget.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"The readmission trial worked, but the shared nursing round lost a third of visits.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"Therapy staff are leaving for city posts, but midwifery has unusual slack due to low births.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shion,,"The development allocation is down a quarter, and home visits earn no tariff from the fund.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"Outpatient rooms book out by mid-morning, and the shuttle only serves four of nineteen villages.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shion, if home visits earn nothing, how do we justify the cost? The ledger is tight.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Misaki, if therapy staff are leaving, a new unit might be hard to staff.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Shizue, if rooms are full, where does the new program fit? The booking system is rigid.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Midori, the joint clinic failure suggests we need clear ownership. I am wary of shared models.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Jonathan, the shuttle gap means many patients cannot reach the hospital easily.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Midori,,"The readmission data is strong, but the shared round failed due to logistics.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"The call-back trial reduced readmissions, but it stopped. We need a sustainable model.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"Midwifery has slack, which is a rare opportunity. Therapy is a drain.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shion,,On-site sessions bill at standard rates. Home visits do not. This changes the economics.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shizue,,The physical infrastructure is a bottleneck. We must choose a program that fits the space.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
